{% comment %}
  Renders the image panel that sits to the right of a mega menu's links.

  Shopify menu items cannot carry images, so the panel comes from a
  mega_menu_promo block on the header section ("Mega menu image panel"), matched
  to a top-level menu link by title.

  Cullinan, 2026-10-03: a <div> now, not a list item. It used to be an <li> inside
  the links' own list, which only reached the right edge when the menu had two
  levels; a menu with one level of links (Пръстени: Дамски, Мъжки) is drawn as a
  plain block and the panel would have fallen under the links. snippets/header-
  mega-menu.liquid puts it beside the list in a body of its own.

  The picture is an empty flat panel until one is uploaded -- no placeholder
  graphic, no stock image -- so the dropdown is finished before the photography
  exists. The label sits beneath the picture and is live text; the one place words
  lie over a picture in this theme is the named exceptions in CLAUDE.md, and
  moonmagic's own panel laying its caption on the photograph is not copied.

  Accepts:
  - link: {Object} the top-level link object
  - section: {Object} the header section

  Usage:
  {% render 'header-mega-promo', link: link, section: section %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign menu_key = link.title | strip | downcase
-%}

{%- for block in section.blocks -%}
  {%- if block.type == 'mega_menu_promo' -%}
    {%- assign block_key = block.settings.menu_item | strip | downcase -%}
    {%- if block_key == menu_key and block_key != blank -%}
      <div class="mega-menu__promo" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
        <a href="{{ block.settings.link | default: '#' }}" class="mega-menu__promo-link">
          {%- if block.settings.image != blank -%}
            {{
              block.settings.image
              | image_url: width: 800
              | image_tag:
                class: 'mega-menu__promo-image',
                widths: '300, 450, 600, 800',
                sizes: '(min-width: 1200px) 32rem, 24rem',
                loading: 'lazy',
                alt: ''
            }}
          {%- else -%}
            <span class="mega-menu__promo-image mega-menu__promo-image--empty" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if block.settings.label != blank -%}
            <span class="mega-menu__promo-label">{{ block.settings.label | escape }}</span>
          {%- endif -%}
        </a>
      </div>
      {%- break -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
